          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/llm-powered-analysis-of-iot-user-reviews-tracking-and-ranking-security-and-privacy-concerns/ >
            
                LLM-Powered Analysis of IoT User Reviews: Tracking and Ranking Security and Privacy Concerns
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Taufiq Islam Protick
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__spacer"></div>
